<title>Pakistan and Afghanistan: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/afghanistan-pakistan/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-afghanistan-pakistan-2026-11-23T15:05:04.863Z</guid>
<pubDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 15:05:04 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Recent violence continues across the Pakistan-Afghanistan border area, with Afghan landmine and unexploded ordnance explosions killing dozens of civilians and a separate incident killing two people in northern Afghanistan. In Pakistan, a stone-laden truck overturned onto a loader in Ahmedpur East, killing seven, while a shooting at a funeral gathering in Sajawal Village resulted in one death, and a land-dispute-related firing in Bannu killed three. Afghan migrants near the Iran border were found shot dead, indicating cross-border insecurity. The conflict still produced 1,794 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinAFBVV95cUxNTVJrLTVkUGp3cHN0QXFSMFpzLVQtTG1OUEs3bVZvb0piZzF3eVJhdzY0YWlPcVlJWjFWZFVhd0VPYmx3QklvMW11YjhSb2tNY1FFR0RUa0JLRzZZNV81OTdldmtvT2hXa1lSR01FZ2Z3cTRwelhsbFM1S1lVaHJBYkxOaVBlTGdXalIxUmR4dDR0Z1VBYlFKYUNrUFc?oc=5&quot;&gt;ReliefWeb&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijwFBVV95cUxPd2lMbWZYSzRacDVRN3NXSFdLQTc1eElHM0tGX3ZlY29jTnNHaHhzOGRHRE94NXpDbjRVYmxzUk1WZjJRZGdCaEhESWUxTGU3cHpSMHhHcUF1NkFwclpPOWREMkhWSjBtUmZCSnBIVlU3LUZOQTVVbEVKX1VlenlDSlBTeGl5dmVUTnNxVFR5dw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Dawn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinAFBVV95cUxQZE00eE12X2V6SDZZRGl6QWxoRUJTRnZlMVZSOTZraHR1VUFobWota2paY2Z4eFRzSUZoTklzSEZQRmlfV1pYQ2hRU1paNWlOYWlTNDRTd3ozSk44RjZ0RWJfRkkweHpfVTR2aWt4Q0RyM0pKWU1OeGtDbkczeFZYWUViSjNBVXNqSXlTdGxFOTVBcTFDemtrcjNTVm0?oc=5&quot;&gt;Dawn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiSEFVX3lxTFBRUXhMSHFnSXdyQy1XWlhEaC1vTi1nRVB4alFWeXFBZ0E2SUs3cjBlb2dmaGF5d0NkV2tJald2SkVxSXM4ekxuTg?oc=5&quot;&gt;Dawn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilgFBVV95cUxNTXBoVkZJWTRxSFdaRGM2em83cUlnUkcyTmZtTkpSb2xqcG9QQWQ2UTBsRnNB